{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 14, :comments ["<b>And after it, there shall not be its like.</b> Now that one which was in the days of Joel, of which it is said, ״כָּמוֹהוּ לֹא נִהְיָה מִן הָעוֹלָם״ (Joel 2) — this teaches that it was heavier than that of Moses. (That of Joel was) by way of many species, for there were together four: יֶלֶק, חָסִיל, גָּזָם, but that of Moses was only one species; and its like never was and never will be."], :book :exodus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 10, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:51:23.141736442Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}